[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1041","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1041.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1325","title":"SAS System VAX/VMS 权限提升漏洞","description":"SAS System 5.18 for VAX/VMS 因安装时目录和启动文件权限设置不当，导致本地用户可利用默认的不安全权限配置进行权限提升攻击。攻击者通过本地访问系统，利用目录或文件的弱权限（如过度宽松的 ACL 或属主设置）替换或修改可执行文件/配置文件，从而获取高于预期的系统权限，实现完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 SAS System 5.18 on VAX/VMS 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。官方建议手动调整相关目录和文件的权限设置以降低风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1325"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:11Z","remediation":"限制 SAS System 5.18 安装目录和启动文件的权限，确保只有授权管理员可读写。对目录执行 `chmod 750`，启动文件执行 `chmod 640`，移除其他用户的写权限。在 VAX/VMS 上设置 ACL 限制访问。若无升级可能，建议迁移到受支持的操作系统版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/c-19.shtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7261","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1325.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1325","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1325.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3f415771bcfb63723b9c0d3f106f197a1964d0e2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1325.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jm5h-qhv5-56m7/GHSA-jm5h-qhv5-56m7.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1325.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001024.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b9213ca3-14e3-4d16-a7ae-ead8dd18b297.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1041.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1039","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1320","title":"Novell NetWare 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Novell NetWare 3.x 及更早版本存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过伪造网络数据包（packet spoofing）向目标系统发送特制报文，利用系统对数据包源地址验证不严的缺陷，绕过访问控制机制获取更高权限。该漏洞影响 Novell NetWare 3.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。攻击者需具备本地网络访问能力，成功利用后可执行越权操作，威胁系统安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1320"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:11Z","remediation":"升级到 Novell NetWare 4.x 或更高版本，该版本修复了数据包欺骗的认证漏洞。如无法升级，在网络交换机上启用端口安全与动态 ARP 检测（DAI），防止局域网内伪造数据包；同时在服务器网卡上绑定静态 MAC 地址，限制只有合法设备能发送认证请求。建议迁移至受支持的现代操作系统。建议立即升级至 Novell NetWare 4.x 或更高版本。如系统已停止支持且无法升级，应在交换机上启用端口安全（Port Security）和动态 ARP 检测（DAI）以防止局域网内数据包欺骗攻击，同时在服务器端配置静态 ARP 绑定。长期建议迁移至受支持的现代平台（如 OES、Windows Server 或 Linux）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/d-01.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7213.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1320.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1320","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1320.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3f415771bcfb63723b9c0d3f106f197a1964d0e2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1320.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rc2p-chmj-rg4f/GHSA-rc2p-chmj-rg4f.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1320.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001022.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ca5ab8a6-abe1-44eb-bf87-3f756f26a751.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1039.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1038","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1038.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1317","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 SP4 及更早版本中存在符号链接表操作漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 \\?? 对象文件夹中使用大小写不同的字母修改符号链接表，将其指向不同的设备对象，从而提升自身权限至系统级别。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，影响所有 Windows NT 4.0 SP4 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1317"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:10Z","remediation":"升级至 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 5 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 SP5 中修复。如无法升级，限制本地用户对 \\?? 对象目录的符号链接操作权限，并移除受影响用户的交互式登录权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92127046701349&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92162979530341&w=2","http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q222/1/59.asp","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7398","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/851a313c6bc1948d5487aca773aa21ade52b7c28/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1317.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1317","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1317.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/929f101fd7b4d4314a4b92f62a8cc2523c6d76f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1317.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fgh9-68h7-45xw/GHSA-fgh9-68h7-45xw.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1317.json","https://github.com/opsxcq/mirror-vxheaven.org/blob/4675a2c53cbb825974e4df213a6b129d5d52c764/vxheaven.org/index.html%3Fdetails=720","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001021.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--23b5b680-7984-4f54-9813-18b17b1b0ce3.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1038.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1037","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1316","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 密码策略安全漏洞","description":"Windows NT SP2 系统中 Passfilt.dll 密码过滤组件存在安全设计缺陷，未有效阻止用户设置包含帐户名的弱密码。攻击者通过社工等手段获取目标系统有效用户名后，可结合用户名信息进行针对性密码猜测或暴力破解攻击，大幅降低密码破解难度。该漏洞影响 Windows NT SP2 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。建议管理员通过组策略强制实施密码复杂度要求并加强密码审计。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1316"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:10Z","remediation":"升级至 Windows NT 4.0 SP3 及以上版本，或安装微软安全补丁。如无法升级，通过组策略编辑器启用密码复杂性要求，禁止密码包含用户名或部分用户名，并设置最小密码长度至少 8 位。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/Q247/9/75.asp","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7391","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/851a313c6bc1948d5487aca773aa21ade52b7c28/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1316.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1316","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1316.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/929f101fd7b4d4314a4b92f62a8cc2523c6d76f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1316.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m9pv-rhw7-3fh9/GHSA-m9pv-rhw7-3fh9.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1316.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001020.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d807e3af-205b-4b29-b446-fd385a964d1b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1037.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1035","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1035.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1307","title":"Novell UnixWare urestore 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Novell UnixWare 1.1 系统中的 urestore 恢复工具存在权限许可漏洞，本地普通用户可利用该程序在处理文件恢复操作时未正确验证权限的缺陷，通过精心构造的恢复请求绕过系统权限检查，从而获取 root 超级用户权限。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，成功利用后可完全控制目标系统，造成机密性、完整性和可用性全面丧失。该漏洞影响 Novell UnixWare 1.1 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1307"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:09Z","remediation":"建议升级到 Novell UnixWare 2.0 或更高版本。如无法升级，可立即移除 `/bin/urestore` 的 setuid 权限：`chmod u-s /bin/urestore`。同时限制本地用户登录权限，仅允许受信任的管理员通过 su/sudo 执行特权操作，并在系统层面启用文件访问审计 (audit) 以监控异常提权行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/f-06.shtml","http://www.dataguard.no/bugtraq/1994_4/0676.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e8d44fc9434dcaf08511a3267e0bf049a6756de/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1307.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1307","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1307.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1307.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4544d3857250fe21711ce8febf38e8822729678f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cr84-5qj8-f776/GHSA-cr84-5qj8-f776.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1307.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fca28a80-1505-4ad5-962e-45d3a10f89e6.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1035.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1034","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1034.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1300","title":"Cray UNICOS accton 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Cray UNICOS 6.1 及 6.0 版本中的 accton 命令存在任意文件读取漏洞。由于程序未对文件路径和访问权限进行充分校验，本地攻击者可通过传入特制参数或利用符号链接攻击的方式，以 accton 进程权限读取系统任意文件内容，同时可修改系统审计（accounting）配置，导致敏感信息泄露及审计日志异常。该漏洞需要本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1300"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:08Z","remediation":"升级 Cray UNICOS 至 6.1 以上版本，或应用厂商针对 accton 的专用补丁。限制 accton 可执行文件的访问权限为仅 root 用户可执行（chmod 700 /usr/sbin/accton），并移除普通用户的 setuid 权限。同时通过文件系统 ACL 限制 /var/adm/pacct 等记账文件的读取权限，仅授权审计员可访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/b-31.shtml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24df5d59670dfe04b9c86de11fa86df63c0d28f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1300.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1300","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1300.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/228df6a85079f5c6b1ecdfb3d41be685458438ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1300.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4544d3857250fe21711ce8febf38e8822729678f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9226-8p5v-w2mm/GHSA-9226-8p5v-w2mm.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1300.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001018.txt","https://git