b/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87793/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1290.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/0bc422e082b7e01390f70e5565b0c87d6b52007c/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1032.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1031","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1031.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1287","title":"Analog 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Analog 3.0 及更早版本中存在任意文件读取漏洞，远程攻击者可通过 forms 接口向目标系统发送特制请求，利用该漏洞读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Analog 3.0 及之前版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级中等。建议用户升级至最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1287"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:06Z","remediation":"立即升级 Analog 至 4.0 或更高版本（最新为 6.0），该漏洞已在 4.0 中修复 forms 接口的路径校验逻辑；若无法升级，在 Web 服务器配置中限制 analog CGI 脚本的访问来源 IP，并移除 forms 接口的执行权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.statslab.cam.ac.uk/~sret1/analog/security.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1410","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/851a313c6bc1948d5487aca773aa21ade52b7c28/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1287.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1287","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1287.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/929f101fd7b4d4314a4b92f62a8cc2523c6d76f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1287.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f974-p775-h8x3/GHSA-f974-p775-h8x3.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87844/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1287.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/0bc422e082b7e01390f70e5565b0c87d6b52007c/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1031.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1031.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1030","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1030.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1279","title":"IBM AS/400 共享文件夹与 Microsoft SNA Server 3.0 及更早版本交互存在信息泄露漏洞","description":"IBM AS/400 共享文件夹功能与 Microsoft SNA Server 3.0 及更早版本之间存在设计缺陷，当多个用户共享相同的本地 APPC LU（逻辑单元）时，AS/400 系统未能正确隔离用户之间的文件夹访问权限，导致用户能够越权查看其他用户的文件夹内容，造成敏感信息泄露。攻击者只需与目标用户共用同一 APPC LU 即可触发该漏洞，无需额外认证，影响范围涉及使用了 AS/400 共享文件夹功能的 SNA Server 环境。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1279"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:05Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft SNA Server 3.0 Service Pack 1（KB Q138001）或升级至 SNA Server 4.0 以修复该问题。若无法升级，可为每个用户或用户组分配独立的 Local APPC LU，避免不同用户共享同一 LU 导致文件夹互可见。同时在 AS/400 端对共享文件夹设置严格的 IBM i 对象级权限，限制非授权用户的文件访问。考虑到 SNA Server 已停止支持，建议迁移至 Microsoft Host Integration Server 以获得持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q138/0/01.asp","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1548","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bab2ad77526cf53e031dbf06b248b9bb97c66bc2/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1279.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1279","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1279.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16a13b6e06deb5f619f278e95f08ffda0e8f5a8e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1279.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3qcq-w2m6-vwwx/GHSA-3qcq-w2m6-vwwx.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87845/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1279.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001013.txt","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/system-vulnerabilities/windows.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1030.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1026","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1259","title":"Microsoft Office 98 Macintosh Edition 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 98 Macintosh Edition 在创建文件时未正确初始化分配的磁盘空间，导致先前删除文件中的残留数据被嵌入到 Office 文件中，造成敏感信息泄露。攻击者可通过获取目标 Office 文件并分析其中未被擦除的磁盘残留数据，恢复出用户此前删除的敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Office 98 Mac 版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，利用难度较高，需物理或远程访问已生成的 Office 文件。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1259"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:03Z","remediation":"该漏洞存在于 Microsoft Office 98 Macintosh Edition，官方补丁见微软知识库文章 Q189529。建议立即安装该补丁，可通过 https://support.microsoft.com/kb/189529 获取。因 Office 98 Mac 版已停止支持多年，强烈建议升级至仍在安全更新周期内的 Microsoft Office for Mac 版本（如 Office 2019 或更高），从根源上消除文件初始化时残留已删除数据导致的信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q189/5/29.asp","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1780","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1259.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1259","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1259.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1259.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4fg5-9xqq-h6cq/GHSA-4fg5-9xqq-h6cq.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87853/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1259.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_infor.txt","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/system-vulnerabilities/windows.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1026.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1012","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1223","title":"Microsoft IIS 3.0 ASP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 3.0 ASP 组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含大量斜杠字符（/）的特制 URL 请求，访问 ASP 页面时触发该漏洞，导致 IIS 服务进程消耗过多资源而崩溃，造成网站服务不可用。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响 IIS 3.0 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1223"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:58Z","remediation":"升级至 IIS 4.0 及以上版本，IIS 3.0 已停止支持且存在此拒绝服务漏洞。如无法升级，可在 IIS 管理器中限制 URL 请求长度，并将 ASP 脚本扩展映射到较新版本的 ASP.dll。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q187/5/03.asp","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3892","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1223.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1223.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1223","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3f415771bcfb63723b9c0d3f106f197a1964d0e2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1223.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1223.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cj4j-jmwc-f6jm/GHSA-cj4j-jmwc-f6jm.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87550/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1223.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1012.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1012.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1011","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1222","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 Netbt.sys 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 Netbt.sys 驱动在处理 DNS 主机名解析返回值时存在缺陷，当恶意 DNS 服务器返回 0.0.0.0 作为 IP 地址时，系统未能正确处理该异常值，导致 Netbt.sys 崩溃并引发蓝屏死机。攻击者只需控制目标系统使用的 DNS 服务器或通过中间人攻击篡改 DNS 响应即可触发此漏洞，无需用户交互。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 系统，属拒绝服务型漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1222"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:58Z","remediation":"Windows NT 4.0 已终止支持，建议升级至 Windows 2000 及以上受支持版本。如无法升级，安装 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6a 及后续安全汇总更新，并在防火墙或 DNS 解析器层面过滤返回 0.0.0.0 的非法 DNS 响应，同时在注册表中限制 Netbt.sys 对恶意 DNS 响应的处理行为作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/Q188/5/71.ASP","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3893","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1222.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1222","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1222.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3f415771bcfb63723b9c0d3f106f197a1964d0e2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1222.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2wcg-78mh-f9m8/GHSA-2wcg-78mh-f9m8.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87559/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1222.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001008.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1010","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1206","title":"SystemSoft SystemWizard ActiveX 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SystemSoft SystemWizard 软件包在 HP Pavilion PC（Windows 98 系统）中安装了两个标记为\"对脚本安全\"的 ActiveX 控件（Launch 控件和 RegObj 控件），远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页调用这些控件执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 HP Pavilion PC 及可能其他平台和操作系统，攻击者只需诱导用户访问恶意网页即可触发，无需任何身份认证。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1206"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:56Z","remediation":"在注册表中为 SystemWizard 的两个 ActiveX 控件（Launch 和 RegObj）设置 killbit，将对应 CLSID 下的 Compatibility Flags DWORD 值设为 0x400，阻止 Internet Explorer 调用；同时卸载 SystemWizard 软件包。建议将操作系统升级至受支持的 Windows 版本以彻底消除遗留 ActiveX 安全风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93336970231857&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/555","http://www.systemsoft.com/l-2/l-3/support-systemwizard.htm","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e8d44fc9434dcaf08511a3267e0bf049a6756de/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1206.json","https://gith