T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www-genome.wi.mit.edu/WWW/tools/CGI_scripts/server_publish/nph-publish","http://www.w3.org/Security/Faq/wwwsf4.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2055","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1177.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24df5d59670dfe04b9c86de11fa86df63c0d28f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1177.json","https://github.com/geeknik/the-nuclei-templates/blob/36a6d14bce3293907a83afb498caec5fd45b1777/CVE-1999-1177.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1177","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d0a8c476da89b37a2bbb6193b7964b10d03aff75/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1177.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-1999-1177.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v755-q23g-3hrx/GHSA-v755-q23g-3hrx.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1177.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/nph-publish.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1002.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1002.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1001","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1175","title":"Cisco IOS Cache Engine WCCP 身份验证缺失漏洞","description":"Cisco Cache Engine（用于 Cisco IOS 11.2 及更早版本）中的 Web 缓存控制协议（WCCP）缺乏身份认证机制，远程攻击者无需任何鉴权即可向目标设备的 UDP 2048 端口发送特制 WCCP 数据包，从而将原本指向合法服务器的 HTTP 流量重定向至攻击者控制的任意主机，进而实现中间人攻击、流量劫持或敏感信息窃取。该漏洞影响大量早期 Cisco 网络设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1175"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:52Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 到 11.3 或更高版本（该版本起 WCCP 支持 MD5 认证），并在网络中配置 ACL 限制 UDP 2048 端口的来源 IP 仅为受信任的缓存引擎设备，拒绝来自外部的 WCCP 流量。如无法升级，可在边界防火墙上丢弃发往 UDP 2048 的非授权数据包作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/i-054.shtml","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/770/wccpauth-pub.shtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1577","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1175.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24df5d59670dfe04b9c86de11fa86df63c0d28f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1175.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1175","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d0a8c476da89b37a2bbb6193b7964b10d03aff75/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1175.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1175.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2qg5-3mg4-mrr4/GHSA-2qg5-3mg4-mrr4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1175.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/cisco-sa-19980513-wccp-auth.nasl","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001005.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--71565265-4d4c-43b5-9801-c1b